      "source_sha256": "908faac25ad42433cc2e0cf8c0ab6826a3245918b4068caa58ad930405f17511",
      "target": "# 记忆块与休眠时计算\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "f253a9064169aa8c7d24c55f1cd7a053d7769ceb0effe443f053046185272428",
      "target": "> 将记忆按功能划分为独立的记忆块（memory block），让模型能够直接编辑；再由休眠时智能体（sleep-time agent）在主智能体（primary agent）空闲时异步（asynchronously）整合（consolidation）记忆。智能体（agent）借助这两个思路，让记忆的范围超越单次对话。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "e37f0d469e7e29ac4cac746e602494a617c2fd74cfc593d95fd0b8e8a663451f",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python (stdlib)\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 14 · 07（MemGPT）\n**Time:** ~75 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "584e52d24f2b17886a76212978741fa03ba6bc6aa292a0331b41402490b42267",
      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "fb58733d0339705ce9f895cf4d7d59a8c3c3f481a649007fdb50c409cd6037ef",
      "target": "- 列出 Letta 使用的三个记忆层级：核心记忆（core）、回忆记忆（recall）和归档记忆（archival），并说明各自的作用。\n- 解释记忆块模式：用户信息块（Human block）、角色设定块（Persona block）以及用户自定义的块，都是具有类型的一等对象（first-class typed objects）。\n- 说明什么是休眠时计算（sleep-time compute）、为什么它不在关键路径（critical path）上，以及为什么它能采用比主智能体更强的模型。\n- 实现一个由脚本驱动的双智能体循环：主智能体负责响应，休眠时智能体在轮次之间整合记忆块。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "0718bb79b104750ab2c1541f26b5fccaef36d7f384a6fdd1c828e87dd8349fc0",
      "target": "MemGPT（第 07 课）解决了虚拟内存（virtual memory）的控制流问题。在生产环境中，随之出现了三个问题：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0015",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "bd80ff8cbd49fe91e394c2cfce88e73f5229244028d2af3c4fa394323e8a3edf",
      "target": "1. **延迟。** 每次记忆操作都处在关键路径上。如果智能体要在用户等待时裁剪、生成摘要或协调不一致的信息，尾延迟（tail latency）就会大幅攀升。\n2. **记忆陈化（memory rot）。** 写入不断累积，与新信息相矛盾的事实仍然留存。检索结果被过时内容淹没。\n3. **结构丢失。** 扁平的归档存储无法表达这样的关系：“用户信息块始终在提示词（prompt）中；角色设定块始终在提示词中；任务块（Task block）则按会话切换。”\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "3d1fe98eb5031dc1e848c3387fe669207cc5f7bf5ff497d5d4b8ecf5b69290b4",
      "target": "Letta（letta.com）是原 MemGPT 项目在 2024 年采用的平台名称，论文提出的模式仍沿用 MemGPT 这一名称；2026 年的 Letta V1 重写则是之后另一个独立的步骤。记忆块让结构变得明确，休眠时计算则将整合工作移出关键路径。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "c7b44801605d0b8c776d3915355cff883fdbf9e3ecb29219ac88ef4edd08ab1b",
      "target": "## 核心概念\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Three tiers"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "0b2662cb6c396f04c0c248a0f64650850641ac86dd4e18009be9fa4f4b2b9b23",
      "target": "### 三个层级\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Three tiers"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0023",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Three tiers"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "e8f8e5c0c26fd79aae7f98fd8b628050076695e7f4f7fefc1de715da4268f81b",
      "target": "| 层级 | 范围 | 存放位置 | 写入方 |\n|------|-------|----------------|------------|\n| 核心记忆 | 始终可见 | 主提示词内部 | 智能体的工具调用（tool call）+ 休眠时重写 |\n| 回忆记忆 | 对话历史 | 可检索 | 自动记录每个轮次 |\n| 归档记忆 | 任意事实 | 向量 + KV（键值）+ 图 | 智能体的工具调用 + 休眠时摄入 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Three tiers"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Three tiers"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "70b6470693d04872955401fb0722aa3494a955a90e7aac5b29c8e334d5f49ece",
      "target": "核心记忆就是 MemGPT 中的核心记忆。回忆记忆是对话缓冲区连同其中已被逐出的尾部内容。归档记忆是外部存储。这种划分解决了 MemGPT 两层结构中职责混杂的问题。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Three tiers"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "0e392f15a9502f07f24c1679c3f0ed27fefc8c930c0878d1b6f82dd2dfb04d7e",
      "target": "### 记忆块\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "d3bd3bcb235963bd36b26ce2fb0717f57e9ab9322acb6245a211bf37f5edc2d1",
      "target": "记忆块是核心层中具有类型、经过持久化（persistent）保存且可编辑的分区。最初的 MemGPT 论文定义了两种：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0031",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "4b3bc4ac00f6dff563006b03f87f08ae55e278b690a1274dcf31faf0e857ef5e",
      "target": "- **用户信息块**：关于用户的事实，如姓名、角色、偏好和目标。\n- **角色设定块**：智能体的自我认知，如身份、语气和约束。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "0cffd4e2e34a6186b2a4b703c42aed680c4b7d4f79538f732b4e958e742da8b1",
      "target": "Letta 将其推广到任意用户自定义的块：用 `Task` 任务块保存当前目标，用 `Project` 项目块保存代码库相关事实，用 `Safety` 安全约束块保存硬性约束。每个块都有 `id`、`label`、`value`、`limit`（字符数上限，character cap）和 `description`（让模型知道何时该编辑它）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "221686acfabd2d094cdf8b6d9ae14f299fdc6f53076d0e434d4fcbf5176baac6",
      "target": "可以通过工具接口编辑这些块：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0037",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Memory blocks"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "c069f671c8e48a6f6857488fe2f7e707defaabf03520767cb61b1eb63243099f",
      "target": "- `block_append(label, text)`\n- `block_replace(label, old, new)`\n- `block_read(label)`\n- `block_summarize(label)`：精简一个接近上限的块。\n"
    },
    {
