    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "a8563f6ea269d5cd3bd2207bb1e7959b8c453bae2d708323c056d9575fdc9a77",
      "target": "### 休眠时计算\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "d1cbe919073e1804b8f8f83e93a2daf3fed8ca50c4ae739f7dcd35335738680a",
      "target": "这是 Letta 在 2025 年新增的机制：在后台运行另一个智能体，让它处在关键路径之外。休眠时智能体处理对话记录和代码库上下文，将 `learned_context`（习得上下文，learned context）写入共享块，并整合归档记录或对其进行失效处理（invalidation）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "fc7c98c6c9633bd25d9f61680a810ebc97a893836acb76481295d3930aa6722f",
      "target": "由此带来以下特点：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0045",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "a0560f027cf5331b32f7f9678e838a3e03ece6d2e1634947748aaa0808edaffb",
      "target": "- **不增加延迟。** 主智能体的响应无需等待记忆操作。\n- **可以采用更强的模型。** 休眠时智能体可以使用更昂贵、更慢的模型，因为它不受延迟约束。\n- **自然形成的整合时段。** 趁用户没有等待时，去重（deduplication）、生成摘要，并将与新信息相矛盾的事实标记为失效。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sleep-time compute"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "96a46d361f099603782473adc936543fd3a1ada858ec053806a485ecc33c0c91",
      "target": "这种模式与人的工作方式相似：先完成任务，再睡上一觉，让长期记忆在夜间逐渐沉淀。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0048",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
