      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Native reasoning"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "5f4f21a049717ba98296d21710719a0d66056209b5ba5bc037b791f7acc5218e",
      "target": "### 原生推理\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Native reasoning"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Native reasoning"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "0ea734d6f37ddfb118ac194d4812584af14b4d4415c25935a5ded26ec6f67510",
      "target": "Letta V1（`letta_v1_agent`，2026）弃用了 `send_message`/心跳机制（heartbeat）和行内的 `Thought:` token（词元），转而采用原生推理（native reasoning）。OpenAI 的 Responses API（API 指应用程序编程接口）与 Anthropic 支持扩展思考（extended thinking）的 Messages API 会通过单独的通道输出推理，并在轮次之间传递（生产环境中跨提供商传递时采用加密形式）。控制循环仍然是 ReAct（推理与行动）。思考轨迹（thought trace）由结构来表达，不再依靠提示词中的格式。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Native reasoning"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
