      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "e48f2c79c9bc0e3211b1cbf1d2444fe3e310e86cd3d570cfcbd8797b3e2458a7",
      "target": "### 这种模式容易在哪些地方出问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Where this pattern goes wrong"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-08:b0055",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Memory Blocks and Sleep-Time Compute",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Where this pattern goes wrong"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "5bad79fbace2554d551a1e65ddb1011abe890be82fcaae819dc7faa36e189ebb",
      "target": "- **记忆块膨胀（block bloat）。** 不停地调用 `block_append` 很快就会触及上限。在那次会导致超限的写入之前，接入记忆块摘要生成器。\n- **静默漂移（silent drift）。** 休眠时智能体重写了一个块，主智能体却始终没有察觉。对记忆块进行版本管理，并在轨迹中展示差异（diff）。\n- **整合过程投毒（poisoned consolidation）。** 休眠时智能体把攻击者能够触及的内容处理后写入核心记忆。第 27 课的内容同样适用于休眠时的这一攻击面。\n"
    },
    {
